DESCRIPTION >
    One row per VLM call (event `model_call`), `call_type` = policy | grounding | reflection.
    The prompt is redacted before it leaves the machine, then stored as sha256 + a truncated preview.
    `step_index` is null for reflection (it runs after the episode).

TOKEN "agent_telemetry_append" APPEND

SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime64(3) `json:$.timestamp`,
    `event_id` String `json:$.event_id`,
    `run_id` String `json:$.run_id`,
    `model` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.model`,
    `learning_enabled` Bool `json:$.learning_enabled`,
    `episode_id` String `json:$.episode_id`,
    `episode_index` UInt32 `json:$.episode_index`,
    `step_index` Nullable(UInt16) `json:$.step_index`,
    `call_type` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.call_type`,
    `prompt_sha256` String `json:$.prompt_sha256`,
    `prompt_chars` UInt32 `json:$.prompt_chars`,
    `prompt_preview` String `json:$.prompt_preview`,
    `output_json` String `json:$.output_json`,
    `latency_ms` Float64 `json:$.latency_ms`,
    `image_count` UInt8 `json:$.image_count`,
    `max_tokens` UInt16 `json:$.max_tokens`,
    `temperature` Float32 `json:$.temperature`,
    `prompt_tokens` Nullable(UInt32) `json:$.prompt_tokens`,
    `generation_tokens` Nullable(UInt32) `json:$.generation_tokens`,
    `finish_reason` Nullable(String) `json:$.finish_reason`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY toYYYYMM(timestamp)
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY call_type, run_id, timestamp
